  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/328/mod-info.png\" alt=\"info\" width=\"1024\" height=\"107\"></p><h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">歡迎來到模組 (法老遺產)</span></h2><h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">此模組以埃及時代/埃及法老時期為背景。</span></h2><h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">想在主世界加入沙漠生態域嗎？下載位置：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mysticrift-pharaohs-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></span></span></h2><h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">西元前3100年</span></h2><h2>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">本模組為您的Minecraft伺服器添加了廣闊的沙漠維度，帶您沉浸於遠古的輝煌歲月！</span></h2><h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">傳送門外觀：</span></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/900/235/portal.png\" alt=\"portal\" width=\"1899\" height=\"958\"></p><h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">啟動傳送門所需物品：</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/547/minecraft-forge_-1.png\" alt=\"recept\" width=\"1038\" height=\"276\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">重要提醒！下載此模組前請務必備份您的Minecraft伺服器，避免大型生態域模組導致伺服器損壞。</span></h1><h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">請注意：若遇到遊戲崩潰或錯誤，請至GitHub（Issues頁面）回報問題。</span></h1><h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意：新建伺服器時，載入世界可能發生建築物重疊生成的現象。</span></h1><h1><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">小提示：請小心機關陷阱 ;)</span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/330/biome.png\" alt=\"sounds\" width=\"1024\" height=\"85\"></span></p><h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">誰不愛寧靜的生態域背景音？我們為此生態域添加了真實環境音效，讓風聲掠過您的耳畔！</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/331/skywater.png\" alt=\"sky /water\" width=\"1024\" height=\"93\"></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">水體與天空的色彩將還原真實埃及的風貌！</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/335/structure.png\" alt=\"structure\" width=\"1024\" height=\"149\"></span></p><h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">我們在生態域中添加了多種建築：神殿、獅身人面像、小型金字塔等！詳見下方圖片。</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/340/spnix.png\" alt=\"spinix\" width=\"1552\" height=\"873\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/343/temple.png\" alt=\"temple\" width=\"1418\" height=\"805\"></span></p><h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">此生態域會自然生成多種Minecraft結構：森林府邸、金字塔、村莊等。</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/329/szhld8n.jpg\" alt=\"mob\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/904/291/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"intelij\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"></span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">本模組使用開發工具：IntelliJ IDEA</span></h1>",
